<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chiron raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chiron raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it raised Chiron Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Chiron gained 1/4 to 20-1/8 in midday trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
